  "title": "Apple Ladybug Treats",
  "description": "Red apples are decorated to look like lady bugs. This is a quick and fun snack that kids will enjoy making and eating. For once kids can play with their food.",
  "authors": [
    "Veronica Lopez Hurtado"
  ],
  "date_published": "2001-02-25T15:47:37-05:00",
